      "headline": "PMT Score Above 32 BISP Re-Survey Guide: Official Procedure to Challenge Poverty Score and Re-Register (2026)",
      "description": "Is your BISP PMT score above 32? Learn how to challenge an ineligible poverty score, qualify for the 2-year NSER dynamic re-survey, update family records, and re-apply.",
